&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400 !important; font-size: 1.3em !important; color: #000;"&gt;&lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/191558/rss" title="blog.getbootstrap.com" style=" color: #D94306;"&gt;Bootstrap 6 Alpha&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; — An early look at the popular framework's first major release since 2021. Modernization is the order of the day, with most Sass variables now CSS variables, ESM-only JS plugins, and it leans on more browser-native features.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mark Otto &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;

&lt;table border=0 cellpadding=0 cellspacing=0 border=0 cellpadding=0 cellspacing=0&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.48em; padding: 0px 18px;"&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400 !important; font-size: 1.3em !important; color: #000;"&gt;&lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/191559/rss" title="ikrishg.github.io" style=" color: #D94306;"&gt;reseter.css 3.0: The Modern CSS Reset&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; — &lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/191560/rss" style=" color: #D94306;"&gt;v3&lt;/a&gt; of this popular CSS reset is a major rework. Both the 'full' and 'mini' variants now ship wrapped in &lt;code&gt;@layer reset&lt;/code&gt; for predictable overrides, use logical properties throughout, and are built with Lightning CSS. And all just ~1KB compressed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Krish Gupta &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;

